# action-field — шаги записи (что показывается — action-field.md)
# Заказ 2026-10-07 после ревизии документации: Action Field — категории; next/previous оборачивают строку
# в коллаут и снимают обёртку; Cleanup убирает Values.
# Его 💬 2026-10-07: включать категории не командой next, а через tagWheel (Field Edit — в Right Block). Сценарий — таблица PENDING GIF action-field в docs/SHOWCASE.md.
title Action Field | Edits of the line, picked in tagWheel
preset visual.tagWheel.fillColor = "#fff3bf"
preset visual.tagWheel.scroller.enabled = true
drop Due
drop Project
open Action field.md
line-width 480
room 400
caret - call the bank
stage New Action Field
say Add Field → Action: edits of the line
settings Tags & PKM
click Add Field
click Action
fill Field name = Edit
click Category to add to Field name
click Insert callout
click Add category
say Insert callout comes with Note, Tip and Warning
pause 900
click Category to add to Edit
click Cleanup
click Add category
say A second category: Cleanup
pause 900
click Add Field
pause 1200
close
stage tagWheel
caret - call the bank
say tagWheel Right → Edit: Insert callout, then its preset Note
cmd open-tagwheel-right
key ArrowUp
key ArrowRight
key ArrowUp
expect - book a table / - call the bank || ==Insert callout **[Note]**==
say Enter → the line goes into a callout
key Enter
expect - book a table / > [!note] / > - call the bank
stage Tip
say tagWheel opens on Note; ↑ → Tip
cmd open-tagwheel-right
key ArrowUp
key Enter
expect - book a table / > [!tip] / > - call the bank
stage Take it off
say The empty slot → the callout is gone
cmd open-tagwheel-right
key ArrowUp
key ArrowUp
key Enter
expect - book a table / - call the bank / - #todo #high || book the flight
stage Cleanup
caret - #todo #high || book the flight
say Cleanup → the Values leave, your text stays
cmd open-tagwheel-right
key ArrowUp
key ArrowUp
key Enter
expect - call the bank / - book the flight
